 style=3D"color: transparent;"></div></figure>
<p>From rows 3 to 5, one possible pattern to observe is that odd-numbered r=
ows have the first even number at position 2. We could also hypothesize tha=
t even-numbered rows have the first even at position 3.</p>
<hr>
<p>To confirm if this observation is consistent, let=E2=80=99s look at some=
 more rows:</p>
