<hr>
<p>Let's continue by displaying a few more rows to figure out what this pat=
tern is:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a 10x10 matrix illustrating a coding patter=
