<p>To understand why this pattern repeats, it=E2=80=99s important to realiz=
e that the first four values of a row are calculated solely from the four v=
alues of the previous row. We can see this visualized below, using the init=
ial representation of the triangle to make it clearer:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
